          "kicker": "About the firm",
          "title": "A small firm, on purpose",
          "text": "<p>Eleanor Harrow and Daniel Vance opened Harrow & Vance in 1998 in a single room above a hardware store on Meridian Street. Today the firm has five attorneys and one office, still on Meridian Street.</p><p>We kept the firm small so that every client works with a lawyer, not a queue. You will have the direct number of the person handling your matter, and you will hear from us before you have to ask.</p>",
